<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":3,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":13,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-06T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T11:13:30.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":34,"name":"April"},"cards":[{"id":49586,"front":"<p>The new car&#039;s paint job had a beautiful _______ that reflected the sunlight. <em>(f\u00e9nyess\u00e9g \/ csillog\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician&#039;s speech was full of empty _______, offering no real solutions. <em>(sz\u00f3lam \/ \u00fcres besz\u00e9d)<\/em><\/p><p>The academic paper provided a detailed _______ of the historical event, exploring various interpretations. <em>(magyar\u00e1zat \/ \u00e9rtelmez\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>She ran a _______ over the difficult passage in the book, trying to understand its deeper meaning. <em>(\u00e1tfut \/ gyorsan elolvas)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">f\u00e9nyess\u00e9g \/ csillog\u00e1s \/ magyar\u00e1zat \/ \u00e9rtelmez\u00e9s \/ sz\u00f3lam<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): matt \/ hom\u00e1lyos \/ \u00e9rthetetlen<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a high _______ = magas f\u00e9nyess\u00e9g (pl. The table had a high _______ that made it look very modern.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 run a _______ over = \u00e1tfutni, gyorsan elolvasni (pl. I&#039;ll just run a _______ over the report before the meeting.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ on something = magyar\u00e1zat, komment\u00e1r valamihez (pl. The professor offered some helpful _______ on the complex theory.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 empty _______ = \u00fcres besz\u00e9d, semmitmond\u00f3 sz\u00f3lam (pl. His promises turned out to be just empty _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: <strong>gloss<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>gloss<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: high gloss \/ gloss over \/ glossary of terms \/ glossy finish<\/span><\/p><p>similar: sheen \/ lustre \/ shine \/ explanation<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: matte \/ dull \/ obscure<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T20:54:15+00:00"},{"id":51241,"front":"<p>Be careful not to _______ your coffee on the new carpet. <em>(kifr\u00f6ccsenteni \/ kiontani)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigation revealed a significant _______ of sensitive data from the company&#039;s servers. <em>(kisziv\u00e1rg\u00e1s \/ kibocs\u00e1t\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient manuscript described a ritual that involved the _______ of sacred oils. <em>(felken\u00e9s \/ ki\u00f6nt\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The accident caused a large _______ of oil into the river, creating an environmental disaster. <em>(ki\u00f6ml\u00e9s \/ sziv\u00e1rg\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kifr\u00f6ccsenteni \/ kiontani \/ kisziv\u00e1rogni \/ ki\u00f6mleni \/ elcs\u00f6p\u00f6gtetni<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megtartani \/ bez\u00e1rni \/ megakad\u00e1lyozni<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ over = kifr\u00f6ccsenteni, kibor\u00edtani (pl. He _______ his drink all over the table.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of = valaminek a ki\u00f6ml\u00e9se\/kisziv\u00e1rg\u00e1sa (pl. There was a huge _______ of water from the burst pipe.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the beans = el\u00e1rulni a titkot (pl. Don&#039;t _______ the beans about the surprise party!)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the milk = kiontani a tejet (pl. Oh no, I _______ the milk!)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>spill<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>spill<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>spill<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: spill the beans \/ spill over \/ spill of oil \/ spill of data<\/span><\/p><p>similar: overflow \/ pour \/ leak \/ shed<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: contain \/ hold \/ prevent<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T21:00:52+00:00"},{"id":51220,"front":"<p>The _______ of the printing press revolutionized the spread of information. (tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny \/ feltal\u00e1l\u00e1s)<\/p><p>She is known for her creative _______ and has patented several new devices. (lelem\u00e9nyess\u00e9g \/ \u00f6tletess\u00e9g)<\/p><p>This new software is a remarkable _______ that will change how we work. (\u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s \/ alkot\u00e1s)<\/p><p>The company invests heavily in research and _______ to stay ahead of the competition. (fejleszt\u00e9s \/ innov\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/p><p>tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny \/ feltal\u00e1l\u00e1s \/ \u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s \/ alkot\u00e1s \/ lelem\u00e9nyess\u00e9g<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): m\u00e1sol\u00e1s \/ ut\u00e1nz\u00e1s \/ eredetis\u00e9g hi\u00e1nya<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a groundbreaking _______ = egy \u00fatt\u00f6r\u0151 tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of the wheel = a ker\u00e9k feltal\u00e1l\u00e1sa (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 industrial _______ = ipari \u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 creative _______ = kreat\u00edv \u00f6tletel\u00e9s\/lelem\u00e9nyess\u00e9g (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a significant _______ = jelent\u0151s tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny\/\u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. null)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>adjective: inventive<\/p><p>adverb: inventively<\/p><p>noun: Invention<\/p><p>verb: invent<\/p><p>common pair: original invention \/ new invention \/ major invention \/ technological invention<\/p><p>similar: creation \/ innovation \/ discovery \/ ingenuity<\/p><p>negative: imitation \/ copy \/ plagiarism<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":49593,"front":"<p>He felt guilty about his _______ thoughts during the sermon. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel explored the _______ desires that led to the protagonist&#039;s downfall. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen \/ romlott)<\/em><\/p><p>Many religious traditions condemn _______ acts as a violation of divine law. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ istentelen \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen)<\/em><\/p><p>The detective suspected a _______ motive behind the seemingly random crime. <em>(rosszindulat\u00fa \/ gonosz \/ b\u0171n\u00f6s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen \/ gonosz \/ istentelen \/ rosszindulat\u00fa<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): er\u00e9nyes \/ j\u00e1mbor \/ szent<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ thoughts = b\u0171n\u00f6s gondolatok (pl. He tried to push away his _______ thoughts.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ desires = b\u0171n\u00f6s v\u00e1gyak (pl. The character was consumed by _______ desires.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ acts = b\u0171n\u00f6s cselekedetek (pl. The court found him guilty of several _______ acts.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ motive = b\u0171n\u00f6s ind\u00edt\u00e9k (pl. The police are investigating a _______ motive.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>sinful<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>sinful<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>sinfully<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>sinfulness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: sinful thoughts \/ sinful desires \/ sinful acts \/ sinful nature<\/span><\/p><p>similar: wicked \/ immoral \/ unholy \/ corrupt<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: virtuous \/ righteous \/ holy<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T21:03:08+00:00"},{"id":51201,"front":"<p>he police ________ed three suspects for questioning after the incident. (feltart\u00f3ztat \/ \u0151rizetbe vesz)<\/p><p>She was ________ed at the airport for over two hours by customs officers. (feltart\u00f3ztat \/ visszatart)<\/p><p>The teacher ________ed him after class to discuss his behaviour. (bent tart \/ visszatart)<\/p><p>He was ________ed without charge for several days before being released. (fogva tart \/ \u0151rizetben tart)<\/p><p>feltart\u00f3ztat \/ \u0151rizetbe vesz \/ visszatart \/ fogva tart<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): szabadon enged \/ elenged \/ felszabad\u00edt<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sb = feltart\u00f3ztat \/ \u0151rizetbe vesz valakit<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 f\u0151n\u00e9v: ________ee = fogvatartott \/ \u0151rizetbe vett szem\u00e9ly<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 f\u0151n\u00e9v: ________ion = fogvatart\u00e1s \/ \u0151rizet \/ iskolai bent marad\u00e1s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ion centre = fogdaint\u00e9zet \/ idegenrend\u00e9szeti fogda<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ne keverd \u00f6ssze: detain = hat\u00f3s\u00e1g tart vissza \/ delay = k\u00e9sleked\u00e9s<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: detain<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: detained \/ detaining<\/p><p>noun: detention \/ detainee<\/p><p>common pair: detain a suspect \/ detain without charge \/ detention centre \/ held in detention<\/p><p>similar: arrest \/ hold \/ confine \/ keep back \/ stop<\/p><p>negative: release \/ free \/ let go \/ discharge<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T20:58:47+00:00"},{"id":51249,"front":"<p>There was a _______ hint of garlic in the sauce that made it delicious. <em>(finom \/ enyhe)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician&#039;s speech contained a _______ criticism of the opposing party&#039;s policies. <em>(burkolt \/ nem egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>The research identified a _______ correlation between the two variables, requiring further investigation. <em>(apr\u00f3 \/ nem nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>She wore a dress with a _______ pattern of tiny flowers, almost imperceptible at first glance. <em>(apr\u00f3 \/ diszkr\u00e9t)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">finom \/ enyhe \/ burkolt \/ apr\u00f3 \/ diszkr\u00e9t<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3 \/ felt\u0171n\u0151 \/ er\u0151s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ difference = finom k\u00fcl\u00f6nbs\u00e9g (pl. There&#039;s a subtle difference between these two shades of blue.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ hint = finom utal\u00e1s (pl. He gave a subtle hint that he wanted to leave.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ change = enyhe v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s (pl. We noticed a subtle change in his behavior.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ criticism = burkolt kritika (pl. Her review contained subtle criticism of the author&#039;s style.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>subtle<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>subtle<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>subtly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>subtlety<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: subtle difference \/ subtle hint \/ subtle change \/ subtle way<\/span><\/p><p>similar: delicate \/ fine \/ nuanced \/ understated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: obvious \/ apparent \/ blatant<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"subtle\nsubtly","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-04T21:03:30+00:00"},{"id":51255,"front":"<p>The children&#039;s faces were full of _______ when they saw the presents. <em>(\u00f6r\u00f6m \/ lelkesed\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>It was a _______ to the organizers that the event ran so smoothly. <em>(megtiszteltet\u00e9s \/ \u00f6r\u00f6mteli dolog)<\/em><\/p><p>The research findings provided a significant _______ to the field of neuroscience. <em>(hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rul\u00e1s \/ fejl\u0151d\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>Her eyes sparkled with _______ as she recounted the tale of her adventures. <em>(ragyog\u0