e9g \/ \u00f6tletess\u00e9g)<\/p><p>This new software is a remarkable _______ that will change how we work. (\u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s \/ alkot\u00e1s)<\/p><p>The company invests heavily in research and _______ to stay ahead of the competition. (fejleszt\u00e9s \/ innov\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/p><p>tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny \/ feltal\u00e1l\u00e1s \/ \u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s \/ alkot\u00e1s \/ lelem\u00e9nyess\u00e9g<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): m\u00e1sol\u00e1s \/ ut\u00e1nz\u00e1s \/ eredetis\u00e9g hi\u00e1nya<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a groundbreaking _______ = egy \u00fatt\u00f6r\u0151 tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of the wheel = a ker\u00e9k feltal\u00e1l\u00e1sa (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 industrial _______ = ipari \u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 creative _______ = kreat\u00edv \u00f6tletel\u00e9s\/lelem\u00e9nyess\u00e9g (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a significant _______ = jelent\u0151s tal\u00e1lm\u00e1ny\/\u00faj\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. null)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>adjective: inventive<\/p><p>adverb: inventively<\/p><p>noun: Invention<\/p><p>verb: invent<\/p><p>common pair: original invention \/ new invention \/ major invention \/ technological invention<\/p><p>similar: creation \/ innovation \/ discovery \/ ingenuity<\/p><p>negative: imitation \/ copy \/ plagiarism<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51226,"front":"<p>I think I _______ my ankle playing soccer yesterday. <em>(megr\u00e1ndul \/ kibicsakl\u00f3dik)<\/em><\/p><p>The doctor advised him to rest and avoid putting weight on the _______ joint. <em>(megs\u00e9r\u00fclt \/ kificamodott)<\/em><\/p><p>Ligamentous _______ is a common sports injury, often resulting from sudden twisting or inversion of the foot. <em>(r\u00e1ndul\u00e1s \/ ficam)<\/em><\/p><p>She winced as she tried to stand, the sharp pain a clear indication that she had _______ her wrist. <em>(megr\u00e1nd\u00edtott \/ kificam\u00edtott)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megr\u00e1ndul \/ kificamodik \/ ficamosodik \/ elcsavarodik<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): meggy\u00f3gyul \/ meger\u0151s\u00f6dik \/ felfriss\u00fcl<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ your ankle = megr\u00e1nd\u00edtani a bok\u00e1t (pl. He _______ his ankle badly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ your wrist = megr\u00e1nd\u00edtani a csukl\u00f3t (pl. She fell and _______ her wrist.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ligament _______ = \u00edz\u00fcleti szalag s\u00e9r\u00fcl\u00e9s (pl. The most common type of _______ is a ligament _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ injury = r\u00e1ndul\u00e1sos s\u00e9r\u00fcl\u00e9s (pl. He has a mild _______ injury.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>sprain<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>sprain<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>sprain<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: sprained ankle \/ sprained wrist \/ sprained ligament \/ sprain injury<\/span><\/p><p>similar: twist \/ wrench \/ strain \/ dislocate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: heal \/ recover \/ strengthen<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T21:01:30+00:00"},{"id":51245,"front":"<p>The teacher gave us an _______ of our progress at the end of the semester. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>A tho