il decided to install a _______ at the busy intersection. (k\u00f6rforgalom \/ forgalomir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3 sziget)<\/p><p>Follow the signs and take the third exit from the _______. (k\u00f6rforgalom \/ k\u00f6r alak\u00fa \u00fat)<\/p><p>He was unfamiliar with the local traffic laws and missed his turn at the _______. (k\u00f6rforgalom \/ csom\u00f3pont)<\/p><p>k\u00f6rforgalom \/ forgalomir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3 sziget \/ k\u00f6r alak\u00fa \u00fat \/ csom\u00f3pont \/ keresztez\u0151d\u00e9s<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): egyenes \u00fat \/ k\u00f6zvetlen \u00fat \/ egyszer\u0171 keresztez\u0151d\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 enter the _______ = bel\u00e9pni a k\u00f6rforgalomba (pl. You need to signal before you enter the roundabout.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 exit the _______ = elhagyni a k\u00f6rforgalmat (pl. Take the second exit from the roundabout.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 drive around the _______ = k\u00f6r\u00f6zni a k\u00f6rforgalomban (pl. He got confused and ended up driving around the roundabout twice.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 navigate the _______ = navig\u00e1lni a k\u00f6rforgalomban (pl. It&#039;s important to navigate the roundabout safely.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: roundabout<\/p><p>common pair: traffic roundabout \/ mini roundabout \/ large roundabout \/ enter the roundabout<\/p><p>similar: traffic circle \/ rotary \/ traffic island \/ circular intersection<\/p><p>negative: straight road \/ direct route \/ intersection<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-08T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51250,"front":"<p>He practiced the guitar for hours every day, _______ improving his skills. <em>(ez\u00e1ltal \/ \u00edgy)<\/em><\/p><p>The company invested heavily in new technology, _______ increasing its production efficiency. <em>(ez\u00e1ltal \/ ennek k\u00f6vetkezt\u00e9ben)<\/em><\/p><p>The study meticulously analyzed the data, _______ revealing subtle correlations previously overlooked. <em>(ez\u00e1ltal \/ ennek r\u00e9v\u00e9n)<\/em><\/p><p>She whispered a secret, _______ binding him to silence. <em>(ez\u00e1ltal \/ \u00edgy)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ez\u00e1ltal \/ \u00edgy \/ ennek k\u00f6vetkezt\u00e9ben \/ ennek r\u00e9v\u00e9n \/ enn\u00e9lfogva<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megakad\u00e1lyozva \/ nem el\u0151id\u00e9zve \/ ellenkez\u0151leg<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ improving = ez\u00e1ltal jav\u00edtva (pl. He studied diligently, thereby improving his grades.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ increasing = ez\u00e1ltal n\u00f6velve (pl. The new policy was implemented, thereby increasing profits.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ causing = ez\u00e1ltal okozva (pl. The accident was caused by negligence, thereby causing significant damage.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ leading to = ez\u00e1ltal vezetve ahhoz (pl. The experiment was a success, thereby leading to a breakthrough.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>thereby<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: thereby increasing \/ thereby improving \/ thereby causing \/ thereby leading<\/span><\/p><p>similar: thus \/ hence \/ therefore \/ consequently<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: preventing \/ hindering \/ obstructing<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-04T20:58:05+00:00"},{"id":51219,"fron