rm in the _______ of his hand.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ reading = teny\u00e9rj\u00f3sl\u00e1s (pl. She was interested in _______ reading.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of a leaf = lev\u00e9l tenyere\/lapja (pl. The intricate veins spread across the _______ of the leaf.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of a glove = keszty\u0171 tenyere (pl. The leather on the _______ of the glove was worn smooth.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>palm<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>palmate<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>palm<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>palm<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: hand palm \/ palm tree \/ palm reading \/ palm oil<\/span><\/p><p>similar: hand \/ palm tree \/ leaf \/ surface<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: back of the hand \/ fingertips \/ knuckles<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T20:59:15+00:00"},{"id":51212,"front":"<p>They finally reached the ________ of the hill after two hours of climbing. (cs\u00facs \/ gerinc)<\/p><p>The wave was at its ________ just before it crashed onto the shore. (cs\u00facspont \/ tet\u0151fok)<\/p><p>The school&#039;s ________ features a golden eagle on a blue background. (c\u00edmer \/ jelk\u00e9p)<\/p><p>The bird had a bright orange ________ on top of its head. (taraj \/ tollb\u00f3bita)<\/p><p>cs\u00facs \/ gerinc \/ cs\u00facspont \/ c\u00edmer \/ taraj<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): v\u00f6lgy \/ m\u00e9lypont \/ alap \/ talpont<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ of a hill \/ wave = hegy cs\u00facsa \/ hull\u00e1m teteje<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = c\u00edmer (iskol\u00e1\u00e9, csapat\u00e9, csal\u00e1d\u00e9)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _____