p><p>The news report seemed to have a political _______. (elfogults\u00e1g \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g)<\/p><p>We need to eliminate any _______ in the hiring process. (elfogults\u00e1g \/ diszkrimin\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/p><p>elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g \/ r\u00e9szrehajl\u00e1s<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): objektivit\u00e1s \/ p\u00e1rtatlans\u00e1g \/ semlegess\u00e9g<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 show _______ = elfogults\u00e1got mutatni (pl. The referee seemed to show _______ towards the home team.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 have a _______ against = elfogults\u00e1ga van valaki\/valami ellen (pl. She felt the teacher had a _______ against her because of her accent.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unconscious _______ = tudattalan elfogults\u00e1g (pl. Many hiring managers struggle with unconscious _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 eliminate _______ = elfogults\u00e1got megsz\u00fcntetni (pl. The company is working to eliminate _______ in its marketing campaigns.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai elfogults\u00e1g (pl. The article was criticized for its obvious political _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: bias<\/p><p>verb: bias<\/p><p>common pair: show bias \/ have a bias against \/ unconscious bias \/ eliminate bias<\/p><p>similar: prejudice \/ partiality \/ favoritism \/ leaning<\/p><p>negative: impartiality \/ objectivity \/ fairness<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51169,"front":"<p>She ________ water into the glass. (\u00f6nteni)<\/p><p>Rain began to ________ heavily. (zuhogni)<\/p><p>He ________ coffee for everyone. (\u00f6nt\u00f6tt)<\/p><p>Tears ________ down her face. (folyni \/ \u00f6mleni)<\/p><p>\u00f6nteni \/ \u00f6mleni \/ folyni<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU)visszatartani \/ meg\u00e1ll\u00edtani<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ___ water \/ drink = folyad\u00e9kot \u00f6nteni\ud83d\udc49 rain ___ = zuhog az es\u0151\ud83d\udc49 tears ___ down = k\u00f6nnyek folynak\ud83d\udc49 nagyon gyakori mindennapi sz\u00f3<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: pour<\/p><p>past: poured<\/p><p>past participle: poured<\/p><p>3rd person: pours<\/p><p>negative: hold back \/ stop<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51218,"front":"<p>The board is likely to _______ the new proposal due to budget cuts. (helytelen\u00edt \/ elutas\u00edt)<\/p><p>My parents _______ of my decision to quit my stable job. (nem helyesel \/ rosszal)<\/p><p>The committee will _______ any application that doesn&#039;t meet the criteria. (nem hagy j\u00f3v\u00e1 \/ elutas\u00edt)<\/p><p>helytelen\u00edt \/ rosszal \/ nem hagy j\u00f3v\u00e1 \/ elutas\u00edt<\/p><p>Negative meaning  <\/p><p>(HU): helyesel \/ t\u00e1mogat \/ j\u00f3v\u00e1hagy\ud83d\udd11<\/p><p> Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of something = rosszal valamit (Vonzat! Pl. She strongly _______ of smoking.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 official _______ = hivatalos elutas\u00edt\u00e1s (Pl. The plan was _______ed by the council.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: disapprove<\/p><p>common pair: strongly disapprove \/ disapprove of a choice \/ disapprove of a behavior<\/p><p>similar: reject \/ condemn \/ frown upon \/ object<\/p><p>negative: approve \/ endorse \/ support \/ authorize<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direc