/ act on behalf \/ speak on behalf<\/span><\/p><p>similar: representation \/ proxy \/ stead \/ name<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: individually \/ personally \/ independently<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"behalf","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-10T10:05:22+00:00"},{"id":51211,"front":"<p>The car ________ed forward suddenly when he pressed the accelerator too hard. (megr\u00e1zk\u00f3dik \/ hirtelen ugrik)<\/p><p>She ________ed her hand away when she touched the hot surface. (kir\u00e1ntja \/ hirtelen visszah\u00faz)<\/p><p>He gave the rope a sharp ________ to test if it was secure. (r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ hirtelen h\u00faz\u00e1s)<\/p><p>Don&#039;t be such a ________! You could have warned her in advance. (alak \/ idi\u00f3ta)<\/p><p>megr\u00e1zk\u00f3dik \/ hirtelen ugrik \/ r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ alak \/ idi\u00f3ta<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): sim\u00e1n mozog \/ finoman h\u00faz \/ kedves ember<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = hirtelen, r\u00e1ngat\u00f3dz\u00f3 mozdulatot tesz<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sth = hirtelen r\u00e1nt \/ h\u00faz valamit<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = hirtelen r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ r\u00e1ngat\u00f3z\u00e1s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun, inform\u00e1lis) = kellemetlen \/ \u00f6nz\u0151 ember (szleng)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 knee-________ reaction = azonnali \/ \u00f6szt\u00f6n\u00f6s reakci\u00f3 (\u00e1tgondolatlan)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: jerk<\/p><p>verb: jerk<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: jerked \/ jerking<\/p><p>common pair: jerk forward \/ jerk away \/ give a jerk \/ knee-jerk reaction<\/p><p>similar: yank \/ tug \/ pull \/ lurch \/ twitch<\/p><p>negative: glide \/ smooth \/ ease \/ gentle pull \/ kind person<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T21:01:34+00:00"},{"id":51217,"front":"<p>He gave her a knowing _______ as he passed the secret note. (kacsint\u00e1s \/ biccent\u00e9s)<\/p><p>She tried to _______ at him to get his attention across the crowded room. (kacsintani \/ jelezni)<\/p><p>The magician performed a quick _______ of the eye, making the coin disappear. (kacsint\u00e1s \/ tr\u00fckk)<\/p><p>Don&#039;t take everything he says so seriously; he&#039;s often just _______. (viccel \/ po\u00e9nkodik)<\/p><p>kacsint\u00e1s \/ biccent\u00e9s \/ jelz\u00e9s \/ mosoly \/ szemrebben\u00e9s<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): komolyan v\u00e9tel \/ szigor\u00fa tekintet \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ at someone = kacsintani valakire (pl. He winked at me from across the bar.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a knowing _______ = tud\u00f3, titkos kacsint\u00e1s (pl. She gave him a knowing wink.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ and _______ = kacsintani \u00e9s mosolyogni (gyakran viccel\u0151dve) (pl. He winked and grinned.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a secret = titokban kacsintani (pl. They winked a secret message to each other.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: wink<\/p><p>verb: wink<\/p><p>common pair: wink and smile \/ wink at \/ a wink of \/ wink of an eye<\/p><p>similar: blink \/ signal \/ nod \/ gesture<\/p><p>negative: stare \/ frown \/ glare<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"7 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51177,"front":"<p>Please take the ________ out before you go to bed. (szem\u00e9t \/ hullad\u00e9k)<\/p><p>That film was absolute ________ \u2014 I can&#039;t believe we watched it. (szem\u00e9t \/ baroms\u00e1g)<\/p><p>Don&#039;t talk ________! You know that&#039;s not true. (baroms\u00e1g \/ ostobas\u00e1g)<\/p><p>She ________ed the idea before anyone had a chance to explain it. (lesz\u00f3l \/ kritiz\u00e1l)<\/p><p>szem\u00e9t \/ hullad\u00e9k \/ baroms\u00e1g \/ ostobas\u00e1g \/ lesz\u00f3l<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): \u00e9rt\u00e9kes \/ igaz \/ hasznos \/ dics\u00e9r<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = szem\u00e9t \/ hullad\u00e9k \/ badars\u00e1g (brit angol!)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = lesz\u00f3l, kritiz\u00e1l, lebecs\u00fcl (inform\u00e1lis)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 talk ________ = baroms\u00e1gokat mond<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ bin = szemetes (brit) = trash can (amerikai)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 amerikai megfelel\u0151: garbage \/ trash<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: rubbish<\/p><p>verb: rubbish<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: rubbished \/ rubbishing<\/p><p>common pair: take out the rubbish \/ talk rubbish \/ rubbish bin \/ absolute rubbish<\/p><p>similar: garbage \/ trash \/ nonsense \/ criticise \/ dismiss<\/p><p>negative: treasure \/ truth \/ praise \/ value<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-08T20:56:24+00:00"},{"id":51253,"front":"<p>The children were playing with _______ toys made of wood. <em>(egyszer\u0171 \/ alapvet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s initial business plan was quite _______, lacking many details. <em>(v\u00e1zlatos \/ nem kidolgozott)<\/em><\/p><p>The archaeological dig uncovered _______ tools, suggesting a very early stage of human development. <em>(kezdetleges \/ primit\u00edv)<\/em><\/p><p>His understanding of quantum physics was _______; he had only read the introductory chapter. <em>(fel\u00fcletes \/ alapfok\u00fa)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">alapvet\u0151 \/ kezdetleges \/ egyszer\u0171 \/ v\u00e1zlatos \/ primit\u00edv<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): fejlett \/ kidolgozott \/ komplex<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ knowledge = alapvet\u0151 tud\u00e1s (pl. He has only _______ knowledge of the subject.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ understanding = alapvet\u0151 meg\u00e9rt\u00e9s (pl. Her _______ understanding of the problem was a good start.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ skills = alapvet\u0151 k\u00e9szs\u00e9gek (pl. The training focused on teaching _______ skills.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ stage = kezdeti szakasz (pl. The project is still in its _______ stage.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>rudimentary<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>rudimentary<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: rudimentary knowledge \/ rudimentary understanding \/ rudimentary skills \/ rudimentary stage<\/span><\/p><p>similar: basic \/ elementary \/ primitive \/ fundamental<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: advanced \/ sophisticated \/ complex<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"rudimentary","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T20:53:24+00:00"},{"id":51164,"front":"<p>They ________ oil from the ground. (kinyerni)<\/p><p>The dentist had to ________ the tooth. (kih\u00fazni)<\/p><p>Data can be ________ from the