ating to charity was seen as an act of penance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 seek _______ = vezekl\u00e9st keresni (pl. She sought penance for her betrayal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 offer _______ = j\u00f3v\u00e1t\u00e9telt felaj\u00e1nlani (pl. He offered penance by working for free.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>penance<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>penance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: do penance \/ act of penance \/ seek penance \/ offer penance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: atonement \/ reparation \/ expiation \/ remorse<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: reward \/ forgiveness \/ indulgence<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"penance\npenance","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-10T10:05:46+00:00"},{"id":51211,"front":"<p>The car ________ed forward suddenly when he pressed the accelerator too hard. (megr\u00e1zk\u00f3dik \/ hirtelen ugrik)<\/p><p>She ________ed her hand away when she touched the hot surface. (kir\u00e1ntja \/ hirtelen visszah\u00faz)<\/p><p>He gave the rope a sharp ________ to test if it was secure. (r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ hirtelen h\u00faz\u00e1s)<\/p><p>Don&#039;t be such a ________! You could have warned her in advance. (alak \/ idi\u00f3ta)<\/p><p>megr\u00e1zk\u00f3dik \/ hirtelen ugrik \/ r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ alak \/ idi\u00f3ta<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): sim\u00e1n mozog \/ finoman h\u00faz \/ kedves ember<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = hirtelen, r\u00e1ngat\u00f3dz\u00f3 mozdulatot tesz<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sth = hirtelen r\u00e1nt \/ h\u00faz valamit<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = hirtelen r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ r\u00e1ngat\u00f3z\u00e1s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun, inform\u00e1lis) = kellemetlen \/ \u00f6nz\u0151 ember (szleng)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 knee-________ reaction = azonnali \/ \u00f6szt\u00f6n\u00f6s reakci\u00f3 (\u00e1tgondolatlan)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: jerk<\/p><p>verb: jerk<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: jerked \/ jerking<\/p><p>common pair: jerk forward \/ jerk away \/ give a jerk \/ knee-jerk reaction<\/p><p>similar: yank \/ tug \/ pull \/ lurch \/ twitch<\/p><p>negative: glide \/ smooth \/ ease \/ gentle pull \/ kind person<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":49577,"front":"<p>The judge was accused of having a _______ against the defendant. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s important to be aware of your own _______ when interpreting data. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d)<\/em><\/p><p>The news report seemed to have a political _______. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>We need to eliminate any _______ in the hiring process. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ diszkrimin\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g \/ r\u00e9szrehajl\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): objektivit\u00e1s \/ p\u00e1rtatlans\u00e1g \/ semlegess\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 show _______ = elfogults\u00e1got mutatni (pl. The referee seemed to show _______ towards the home team.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 have a _______ against = elfogults\u00e1ga van valaki\/valami ellen (pl. She felt the teacher had a _______ against her because of her accent.)<\