any has a _______ network of stores across the country. (kiterjedt \/ sz\u00e9lesk\u00f6r\u0171)<\/p><p>She felt a _______ sense of relief when the exam was over. (m\u00e9ly \/ hatalmas)<\/p><p>They explored a _______ forest, full of ancient trees. (hat\u00e1rtalan \/ terjedelmes)<\/p><p>hatalmas \/ \u00f3ri\u00e1si \/ kiterjedt \/ hat\u00e1rtalan \/ terjedelmes \/ sz\u00e9lesk\u00f6r\u0171<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): kicsi \/ sz\u0171k \/ korl\u00e1tozott<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ amount = hatalmas mennyis\u00e9g (pl. There was a _______ amount of evidence.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ majority = hatalmas t\u00f6bbs\u00e9g (pl. The proposal passed with a _______ majority.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ difference = hatalmas k\u00fcl\u00f6nbs\u00e9g (pl. There is a _______ difference between the two proposals.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ expanse = hatalmas kiterjed\u00e9s (pl. They gazed out at the _______ expanse of the ocean.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>adjective: vast<\/p><p>adverb: vastly<\/p><p>common pair: vast majority \/ vast amount \/ vast difference \/ vast expanse<\/p><p>similar: huge \/ immense \/ enormous \/ extensive<\/p><p>negative: small \/ limited \/ tiny<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T21:01:56+00:00"},{"id":51248,"front":"<p>The witch whispered a secret _______ to make the potion bubble. <em>(var\u00e1zsige \/ b\u0171b\u00e1j)<\/em><\/p><p>Ancient texts describe the use of solemn _______ to invoke divine intervention. <em>(szertart\u00e1sos ima \/ fellebbez\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study analyzed the linguistic structure of ritualistic _______ found in early Mesopotamian cultures. <em>(ritu\u00e1lis sz\u00f6veg \/ var\u00e