ir: performance assessment \/ risk assessment \/ needs assessment \/ initial assessment<\/span><\/p><p>similar: evaluation \/ appraisal \/ judgment \/ estimation<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: neglect \/ ignorance \/ disregard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T20:59:22+00:00"},{"id":51214,"front":"<p>The cat ________ed onto the windowsill in one smooth movement. (ugrik \/ felugrott)<\/p><p>She took a ________ of faith and accepted the job offer abroad. (ugr\u00e1s \/ mer\u00e9sz l\u00e9p\u00e9s)<\/p><p>Prices ________ed by twenty percent in just one month. (ugr\u00e1sszer\u0171en n\u0151tt \/ megugrott)<\/p><p>He ________ed at the chance to work with such a talented team. (kapva kapott \/ lelkesen fogadta)<\/p><p>ugrik \/ ugr\u00e1s \/ mer\u00e9sz l\u00e9p\u00e9s \/ megugrott<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): lassan halad \/ apr\u00e1nk\u00e9nt l\u00e9p \/ visszaesik<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = ugrik \/ hirtelen nagy l\u00e9p\u00e9st tesz<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ at sth = kapva kap valamin \/ lelkesen fogad valamit<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ of faith = vak ugr\u00e1s \/ mer\u00e9sz, bizonytalan l\u00e9p\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ szab\u00e1lytalan \/ szab\u00e1lyos is: leapt VAGY ________ed (mindkett\u0151 helyes!)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 by ________s and bounds = ugr\u00e1sszer\u0171en \/ rohamosan<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: leap<\/p><p>past tense \/ past participle: leapt \/ leaped<\/p><p>noun: leap<\/p><p>common pair: leap at \/ leap of faith \/ leap forward \/ by leaps and bounds \/ quantum leap<\/p><p>similar: jump \/ spring \/ bound \/ surge \/ soar<\/p><p>negative: crawl \/ creep \/ decline \/ drop gradually<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":6,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"7 nap","good":"15 nap","easy":"20 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51231,"front":"<p>Be careful not to _______ the water supply with chemicals. <em>(szennyez \/ megfert\u0151z)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigation revealed that the food had been _______ during processing. <em>(fert\u0151z\u00f6tt\u00e9 v\u00e1lt \/ szennyezett\u00e9 v\u00e1lt)<\/em><\/p><p>Environmental regulations aim to prevent industries from _______ natural resources. <em>(k\u00e1ros\u00edt \/ szennyez)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient artifact was _______ by centuries of burial in the damp soil. <em>(megrong\u00e1l\u00f3dott \/ szennyez\u0151d\u00f6tt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">szennyez \/ fert\u0151z \/ megront \/ beszennyez \/ rombol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tiszt\u00edt \/ steriliz\u00e1l \/ megtiszt\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the water = a vizet szennyezni (pl. Pollution can _______ the water.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the food = az \u00e9telt megfert\u0151zni\/beszennyezni (pl. Improper handling can _______ the food.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the air = a leveg\u0151t szennyezni (pl. Industrial emissions _______ the air.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the soil = a talajt szennyezni (pl. Pesticides can _______ the soil.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>contaminate<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>contaminated<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>contaminatingly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>contamination<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>contaminate<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: water contamination \/ food contamination \/ air pollution \/ soil contamination<\/span><\/p><p>similar: pollute \/ taint \/ infect \/ defile<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: purify \/ cleanse \/ sterilize<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"contaminated contaminatingly contamination","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T10:06:01+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/34\/study","version":"8f4ca32974876a648b2aa33abd3f4aea","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div>